   "no": 1,
   "en": "PROBLEM",
   "title": "当前做法与问题",
   "html": "<p>选钻头时需要结合岩石强度、研磨性和相似井使用记录。把候选钻头的历史表现及其与目标地层的相似程度一并展示，比只给出单个型号更便于讨论。</p><p>PDC以固定切削齿剪切破岩，牙轮通过滚动齿体作用于岩石。岩石强度描述抵抗破坏的能力，研磨性描述对工具磨蚀的倾向；同一类钻头在不同地层表现会不同。</p><p>不同地层中的历史钻速不可直接横比；忽视工具费用和换钻代价也可能使高钻速方案并不经济。</p><div class='figure'><svg class=\"chart scene-art\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 408\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"钻头选型：先比较地层，再比较成本\"><title>钻头选型：先比较地层，再比较成本</title><g font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"><text x=\"24\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"600\">钻头选型：先比较地层，再比较成本</text><text x=\"24\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"12\" >A/B/C为教学候选；造型仅解释破岩方式，不对应商业型号</text><rect x=\"28\" y=\"82\" width=\"664\" height=\"224\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"var(--paper-2,#eef3f8)\" stroke=\"var(--line,#dfe6f0)\"/><path d=\"M83 115h44v45h-44Z\" fill=\"#879ba4\" stroke=\"#566e7b\"/><path d=\"M60 160h90l15 70-60 30-60-30Z\" fill=\"#647e8c\" stroke=\"#a8bbc4\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M76 168v67\" stroke=\"#aebbc1\" stroke-width=\"9\"/><path d=\"M105 168v67\" stroke=\"#aebbc1\" stroke-width=\"9\"/><path d=\"M134 168v67\" stroke=\"#aebbc1\" stroke-width=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"148\" cy=\"223\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"137.93991105411607\" cy=\"235.21296458404424\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"112.466871639678\" cy=\"241.71134730723196\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"83.50000000000001\" cy=\"239.45448267190434\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"64.59321730620594\" cy=\"229.49838272318772\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"64.59321730620593\" cy=\"216.50161727681228\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"83.49999999999999\" cy=\"206.54551732809568\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"112.46687163967799\" cy=\"204.28865269276804\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"137.93991105411604\" cy=\"210.78703541595576\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><text x=\"105\" y=\"287\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">PDC切削齿</text><path d=\"M301 115h44v45h-44Z\" fill=\"#879ba4\" stroke=\"#566e7b\"/><path d=\"M278 160h90l15 70-60 30-60-30Z\" fill=\"#647e8c\" stroke=\"#a8bbc4\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"295\" cy=\"219\" r=\"23\" fill=\"#9daeb6\" stroke=\"#c5b17c\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"351\" cy=\"219\" r=\"23\" fill=\"#9daeb6\" stroke=\"#c5b17c\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"323\" cy=\"243\" r=\"23\" fill=\"#9daeb6\" stroke=\"#c5b17c\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><text x=\"323\" y=\"287\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">牙轮滚动齿</text><path d=\"M519 115h44v45h-44Z\" fill=\"#879ba4\" stroke=\"#566e7b\"/><path d=\"M496 160h90l15 70-60 30-60-30Z\" fill=\"#647e8c\" stroke=\"#a8bbc4\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M512 168v67\" stroke=\"#aebbc1\" stroke-width=\"9\"/><path d=\"M541 168v67\" stroke=\"#aebbc1\" stroke-width=\"9\"/><path d=\"M570 168v67\" stroke=\"#aebbc1\" stroke-width=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"584\" cy=\"223\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"573.939911054116\" cy=\"235.21296458404424\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"548.4668716396781\" cy=\"241.71134730723196\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"519.5\" cy=\"239.45448267190434\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"500.59321730620593\" cy=\"229.49838272318772\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"500.59321730620593\" cy=\"216.50161727681228\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"519.5\" cy=\"206.54551732809568\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"548.466871639678\" cy=\"204.28865269276804\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><circle cx=\"573.939911054116\" cy=\"210.78703541595576\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#d0b56c\" stroke=\"#8c7540\"/><text x=\"541\" y=\"287\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\">耐磨PDC</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"333\" font-size=\"15\" >目标 90 MPa / 研磨性 0.60 / 预算 18 万元</text><g><rect x=\"30\" y=\"355\" width=\"203\" height=\"32\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"var(--card,#fff)\" stroke=\"var(--line,#dfe6f0)\"/><text x=\"131.5\" y=\"376\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">预算 8 万元</text></g><g><rect x=\"250\" y=\"355\" width=\"203\" height=\"32\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"var(--card,#fff)\" stroke=\"var(--line,#dfe6f0)\"/><text x=\"351.5\" y=\"376\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">预算 12 万元</text></g><g><rect x=\"470\" y=\"355\" width=\"203\" height=\"32\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"var(--card,#fff)\" stroke=\"var(--line,#dfe6f0)\"/><text x=\"571.5\" y=\"376\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\">预算 21 万元</text></g></g></svg></div><div class='figcap'><b>场景图解</b><span>物件造型为概念示意；图中工程状态与当前默认输入对应。</span></div>"
